    <docsUrl>https://help.mikrotik.com/docs/spaces/ROS/pages/139526145/FlashFig</docsUrl>
    <releaseNotes>## MikroTik Flashfig 6.49.21

Portable `flashfig.exe` (x86) from download.mikrotik.com. The Flashfig version tracks the RouterOS version (same as The Dude).
    </releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
